{"availability":"available","full":"aws-samples/sample-collaborative-ai-dlc","name":"sample-collaborative-ai-dlc","description":"AI-DLC: Collaborative AI-Driven Development Lifecycle","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"JavaScript","stars":96,"forks":35,"created":"2026-04-15T09:49:41Z","updated":"2026-10-08T20:42:58Z","license":"MIT-0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://aws-samples.github.io/sample-collaborative-ai-dlc/","topics":[],"demo":"https://aws-samples.github.io/sample-collaborative-ai-dlc/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T06:28:15.274Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T06:28:15.274Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T06:28:15.274Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T03:37:57.041Z","stars":94,"forks":35},{"at":"2026-10-12T06:28:15.274Z","stars":96,"forks":35}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Your whole team and their coding agents, building in one live workspace.","Collaborative AI-DLC is where a team of humans collaborates in real time with multiple remote coding agents, following the structured AI-DLC methodology. It is an early-preview AWS sample you deploy into your own AWS account: it runs the agents you already use — Kiro, Claude Code, OpenCode, Codex — in isolated cloud sessions and walks every intent through a governed lifecycle — requirements, human approval gates, parallel implementation, pull request, and a traceability graph the whole team can read.","AI-DLC is the AI-Driven Development Life Cycle methodology: phases, stages, artifacts, agent personas, and human validation gates. Collaborative AI-DLC is this platform: a shared orchestration and governance layer over those existing coding agents, not another coding assistant."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aws-samples/sample-collaborative-ai-dlc/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"2acf6fd8c2e496e261b75b1f2421f9257fbb111cf9701bc10f53a65116759dd9","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T03:37:57.229Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T03:37:57.229Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Your whole team and their coding agents, building in one live workspace.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aws-samples/sample-collaborative-ai-dlc/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"After installation, sign in at the URL reported by:","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aws-samples/sample-collaborative-ai-dlc/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"Then configure agent credentials in Admin → Agents (a Bedrock API key for Claude Code / OpenCode / Codex, or a Kiro API key) and follow Your first intent.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aws-samples/sample-collaborative-ai-dlc/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"You need an AWS account with permissions to manage VPC, ECS, ECR, Lambda, API Gateway, DynamoDB, Neptune, S3, CloudFront, Cognito, Bedrock AgentCore, Secrets Manager, Systems Manager Parameter Store, and IAM.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aws-samples/sample-collaborative-ai-dlc/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"A Kiro administrator must first enable API key generation in the Kiro console.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aws-samples/sample-collaborative-ai-dlc/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"2acf6fd8c2e496e261b75b1f2421f9257fbb111cf9701bc10f53a65116759dd9","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aws-samples/sample-collaborative-ai-dlc/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T03:37:57.229Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-08T20:42:58Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aws-samples/sample-collaborative-ai-dlc/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T03:37:57.231Z","hash":"2acf6fd8c2e496e261b75b1f2421f9257fbb111cf9701bc10f53a65116759dd9","originalBytes":34206,"storedBytes":34206,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T03:37:57.041Z","subjects":[],"platforms":[],"classification":{"v